flowchart TD
    A([开始]) --> B["输入<br/>M: 打包整数<br/>序列: [a1,a2,a3,a4,a5]"]

    B --> C["data = [0,0,0,0,0]"]

    C --> D{i >= 1?}

    D -->|是| E["data[i] = floor(M / a_i)<br/>M = M mod a_i<br/>i = i - 1"]
    E --> D

    D -->|否| F["输出<br/>data = [d1,d2,d3,d4,d5]"]

    F --> G([结束])

    style B fill:#74c0fc
    style C fill:#f8f8f8
    style F fill:#51cf66